.TH BACKGROUND 2 2000-1月 "append.id_terms" "append.id_terms"
.SH NAME
append.id_terms \- Append id terms to a given gsea background
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIappend.id_terms(\fBbackground\fR as <generic> Background, 
\fBterm_name\fR as string, 
\fBterms\fR as list, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Append id terms to a given gsea background
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBbackground\fB \fR\- the GSEA background model object, this model will be modified in place.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBterm_name\fB \fR\- the term name that will be written into the \fBname\fR field of the :class:\fBBackgroundGene.term_id\fR.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBterms\fB \fR\- 
 a named list of the term id vector, the name of each slot is the gene id and the
 value is the term id vector of that gene.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the given background model with the new term id information appended.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
background
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
